# Live Trading

Full reference: `docs/PROJECT_CONTEXT.md`

## Config merge

- `resolve_live_startup()` in `provider_utils.py` merges `config/live.yaml` with API overrides
- Flattened `risk:` block goes into engine config (kill switch, exposure limits, `regime_overlay`)
- Empty `POST /api/live/start` body uses YAML defaults

## Auto-start (systemd)

- `FIRM_AUTO_START_LIVE=1` → `bootstrap_live_from_yaml()` in `live.py`
- Runs via `asyncio.to_thread()` in `app.py` lifespan — not on uvicorn's event loop
- Failures are logged; API stays up for manual start

## Providers

- `build_live_providers("ibkr_paper")` → IBKR prices/sentiment + FMP fundamentals if `FMP_API_KEY` set
- `filter_strategies_for_providers()` drops `multi_factor`, `event_driven` without fundamentals
- Data provider uses `client_id=2`; broker uses `IBKR_CLIENT_ID`

## Approval modes

Only `full_auto` and `semi_auto` are valid. Anything else queues all orders.

## Live config round-trip (behavioural knobs)

- `GET`/`PUT /api/live/config` and `POST /api/live/start` round-trip `news_guard`, `signal_combination`, `allocation_method`, `kelly_fraction` (alongside strategies/risk/universe)
- Apply on a running engine via setters: `update_news_guard()` (sets `_news_guard_*` attrs), `update_signal_combination()` / `update_allocation()` (merge `_config` + **rebuild orchestrator**)
- YAML in `config/live.yaml`; `resolve_live_startup()` seeds `engine_config`; explicit request fields override
- UI: `frontend/src/pages/LiveConfig.tsx`

## Ops

- Status: `GET /api/live/status` — watch `cycle_running_seconds` for stuck cycles
- Unit: `deploy/ai-trading.service`
